# Public surface doc

When a feature is added or changed on a module (HTTP route, JSON body/shape, status codes, contract interface, DTO, event), update `modules/<name>/docs/doc.md` in the **same turn**.

That file is how other modules and external clients use the module. Stale `doc.md` = incomplete work.

Do not split it into `api.md` / `contracts.md`. Do not skip the update because the code compiled.
